%[text] Given the five element vector   $a = \\left\\{ \\matrix{1 \\cr 2 \\cr 3 \\cr 4 \\cr 5} \\right\\}$.
%[text] Choose the vector $b$ so that the the inner product $c = a^T b$ is the mean of $a$.  ($c$ is a scalar and should be 3.)
